===Etymology===
{{etyl|la|en}} {{term|post||afterwards|lang=la}} + {{term|mortem|lang=la}}, from {{term|mors||death|lang=la}}.

===Adverb===
{{en-adv|head=[[post]] [[mortem]]|-}}

# Occurring after [[death]].
#: ''The injuries were found to have been caused '''post mortem'''.''

