===Noun===
{{en-noun|head=[[post]] [[mortem]]}} (abbreviated as ''[[PM]]'')

# An [[investigation]] of a [[corpse]] to determine the cause of [[death]]; an [[autopsy]]
# {{context|figuratively|management|lang=en}} Any investigation after something considered unsuccessful, especially used of meetings, games and sports, software development, and projects of any kind.

